# The whole tape, as a recipe. This is the structure the segment split cut the
# v1 script into -- kept here so the order and the session-level automation are
# never only implicit in a rendered session. Renovate segments freely; this file
# is what remembers how they assemble.
#
# surf / bed cues are session-level by design (plan §13): they live here, never
# inside segments, so the bed stays continuous across every seam.
#
# The affirmation is the 1977 original rather than the settled form: the
# route enters F23, F25 and F26, which levels.json marks as populated by minds
# the listener did not choose. The tape's own preparatory process is
# expanded through reusable components, so which affirmation fills that
# slot is this library's choice and not a claim about the source.

@title    Focus 27 — The Place of Your Own
@level    F10
@ending   stay
@pan      right
@seed     2727
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use opening
use comfort
use orientation
use ocean

surf 0.30
use conversion-box
use affirmation-1977

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning
use balloon
use return-methods
use clear-skies

surf 0.0
use relax-10

use climb-f10-f12
use briefing-f12
use free

use climb-f12-f15
use briefing-f15
use free

use climb-f15-f21
use briefing-f21

use climb-f21-f23
use briefing-f23

use climb-f23-f25
use briefing-f25

use climb-f25-f26
use briefing-f26

use climb-f26-f27
use briefing-f27

bed 0.38 0.03
use place-of-your-own
use stay
